# Limzy — Make advertising easier

**Limzy** is an AI advertising platform that lets anyone launch and run ads across multiple channels from one place — starting with just a website URL.

🌐 [limzy.ai](https://limzy.ai/en) · 🚀 [Start advertising](https://app.limzy.ai)

## What Limzy does

1. **URL AI diagnosis** — enter a site URL; AI analyzes the brand, products, and ad objective
2. **Channel recommendations** — AI suggests the best-fit ad channels for the business
3. **AI Studio** — generates on-brand ad creatives automatically
4. **Target audience** — AI-recommended targeting by demographics, industry, and interests
5. **Multi-channel launch** — launch once, run everywhere

After launch, Limzy keeps working: it learns the best-performing hours, shifts budget toward channels that respond well, and surfaces performance and recommendations in a single dashboard.

## Channels

Limzy connects to major ad platforms through a unified integration layer, and new channels are added continuously.

**Currently live:** Google Ads · Meta (Facebook/Instagram) · Kakao Moment · LinkedIn Ads

**Expanding to:** more search, social, messaging, and commerce platforms across Korea and Southeast Asia.

## Who it's for

- Solo entrepreneurs and freelancers
- Small B2C brands and online stores
- Early-stage startups with limited budgets

